# value-eye — шаги записи (что показывается — value-eye.md)
# Заказ 2026-10-07 после ревизии документации: глаз у Value — скрытый Value пропускается next и tagWheel;
# строка, где он уже стоит, его держит. Его 💬 2026-10-07: показывать tagWheel и Scroller, а не Status next. Сценарий — таблица PENDING GIF value-eye в docs/SHOWCASE.md.
preset visual.tagWheel.fillColor = "#fff3bf"
title Hide a Value | The eye takes a Value out of next, previous and tagWheel
drop Priority
drop Due
drop Project
preset visual.tagWheel.scroller.enabled = true
open Value eye.md
line-width 480
caret - call the bank
stage Default
say Default: tagWheel walks #todo → #doing → #done
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowUp
key ArrowUp
expect - pay the rent / - ==**[#doing]**== || call the bank
key ArrowUp
key Escape
stage The eye on #doing
say The eye in front of a Value hides it
settings Tags & PKM
spot Values
pause 1500
click Hide #doing from next, previous and tagWheel
pause 1200
close
caret - call the bank
say tagWheel goes from #todo straight to #done
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowUp
key ArrowUp
expect - pay the rent / - ==**[#done]**== || call the bank
key Escape
stage A line that has it
caret - #doing || book a table
say A line with #doing keeps it; the next step is #done
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - call the bank / - #done || book a table
